## Summary

This is a Spring PetClinic-style app using the OfficeFloor framework, where owner-creation logic is a pipeline of small "function" classes defined in `owners.POST.yml`. Membership level is computed at creation time and frozen.

## 1. Where membership level is computed

**`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/function/owner/AssignOwnerMembershipLevel.java`** (entire file, 31 lines)

The computation is in `service` (lines 19-30):
```java
public void service(@Val Owner owner) {
    int level = 1;
    String email = owner.getEmail();
    if (email != null && !email.isBlank()) {
        level++;
